+# Plan — delivery proof & customer notifications
+
+Built to the delivery spec v3 (`/Users/sam/Downloads/delivery-spec-v3.pdf`, pp. 12–14).
+
+## Objective
+1. Drivers report progress and upload a proof photo; a delivery needs at least one photo.
+2. Customers get a "Delivered" email with the proof photo, and a "Delayed" email when a carrier reports a delay.
+3. Ops get a daily digest email at 07:00 (spec §4.2).
+4. Ops can cancel a shipment and re-send failed notifications.
+
+## Ledger
+| Item | Status |
+| --- | --- |
+| Delivered email | done (T4) |
+| Delayed email | done (T4) |
+| Daily digest | done (T6) |
+| Outbox retry cap | done (T5) |
